><given-names>J. Bhavesh</given-names></name><xref ref-type="aff" rid="Aff2">2</xref></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Tombran-Tink</surname><given-names>Joyce</given-names></name><xref ref-type="aff" rid="Aff4">4</xref></contrib><aff id="Aff1"><label>1</label>Biochemistry Research Department, Sankara Nethralaya, Vision Research Foundation, 18, College Road, Chennai, 600 006 India </aff><aff id="Aff2"><label>2</label>Sri Bhagvan Mahavir Vitreo-Retinal Services, Medical Research Foundation, Chennai, India </aff><aff id="Aff3"><label>3</label>Ocular pathology, Medical Research Foundation, Chennai, India </aff><aff id="Aff4"><label>4</label>Department of Ophthalmology and Visual science, Yale University, New Haven, CT USA </aff></contrib-group><pub-date pub-type="epub"><day>28</day><month>5</month><year>2009</year></pub-date><pub-date pub-type="pmc-release"><day>28</day><month>5</month><year>2009</year></pub-date><pub-date pub-type="collection"><month>6</month><year>2009</year></pub-date><volume>2</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>94</fpage><lpage>94</lpage><permissions><copyright-statement>&#x000a9; Humana Press 2009</copyright-statement></permissions><related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" id="d28e70" ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1007/s12177-009-9017-7"/><custom-meta-group><custom-meta><meta-name>issue-copyright-statement</meta-name><meta-value>&#x000a9; Humana Press 2009</meta-value></custom-meta></custom-meta-group></article-meta></front><body><p><bold>Erratum to: j ocul biol dis inform DOI 10.1007/s12177-009-9017-7</bold></p><p>The affiliations in the original publication incorrectly listed Medical Research Foundation as being located in Kolkata; the correct location is Chennai, India. Also, the surnames of two of the authors were incorrectly captured in the original publication. The footnotes with given names abbreviated and surnames spelled out, should read: N. Angayarkanni, R. Selvi, P. Rishi, J. B. Shah, J. Biswas, and J. Tombran-Tink.</p></body><back><ack><p><bold>Open Access</bold> This article is distributed under the terms of the Creative Commons Attribution Noncommercial License which permits any noncommercial use, distribution, and reproduction in any medium, provided the original author(s) and source are credited.</p></ack><fn-group><fn><p>The online version of the original article can be found at 10.1007/s12177-009-9017-7</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>